Recommends: python3-pip
Suggests: systemd
Description: Manage immutable tree-shaped btrfs snapshots
 dsnap manages tree-shaped btrfs snapshot layouts, letting a system be
 deployed, restored and exported as immutable snapshot trees.
 .
 Requires the python anytree module at runtime (pip install anytree).
